The deterministic elementary-function algorithms in this project are managed
adaptations of algorithms from FDLIBM 5.3 (Freely Distributable LIBM), developed
at Sun Microsystems, Inc. The functions are independently expressed in C# and
use e_exp.c, e_log.c, e_rem_pio2.c, k_sin.c and k_cos.c reduction methods and
coefficients. The square-root implementation uses exact integer arithmetic.

